  "prefLabel": "Tre 201.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tre 201.01 Purpose. This chapter provides procedural rules for the conduct of hearings before the treasury and establishes procedures for acquiring sufficient information to make fair and reasoned decisions.\n\nSource. #7589-A, eff 11-7-01; ss by #9575-A, eff 10-22-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tre200.html"
